+---
+id: task-003-validate-task-input
+type: task
+title: "Validate task input"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+# Validate task input
+
+Request: reject invalid input with a clear error, when a task is added, renamed or tagged; nothing changes on rejection.
+
+- A title that is empty or only spaces, or longer than 120 characters (after trimming), is rejected.
+- A priority other than `low`, `normal` and `high` is rejected.
+- A tag that is empty or contains a space is rejected (tags given to `add` too).
+- Failures are returned as `Result` errors with the new code `invalid-input`, whose message says what is wrong.
